This repository packages original application and verification code as a white-label starter. It does not redistribute the underlying mail server, webmail application, calendar/files server, Qoder, or Neo4j.

The mail-admin HTTP adapter was originally developed against the Mail-in-a-Box admin API. Renaming the adapter does not make it compatible with arbitrary mail providers; implement and verify the documented contract for your chosen backend. Upstream brands are not part of the starter's product interface.

